  2048         823ms          1224ms      1.49x
  4096        2448ms          3825ms      1.56x
PASS  at LONG context the hybrid clearly wins on CPU   | 1.56x at L=4096
PASS  and the advantage grows with length   | 1.02x at 256 -> 1.56x at 4096
PASS  so at SHORT context there is essentially nothing to gain   | 1.02x — the title says LONG context for a reason

